{"articleNo":"94692","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=94692&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014 루마니아 정부초청 장학생 선발요강 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.11.11","hit":"3388","attachments":[{"name":"4. 2014 루마니아 DB 양식.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=94692&attachNo=72166"},{"name":"1. 2014 루마니아정부초청정학생 선발요강.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=94692&attachNo=72289"},{"name":"3. 지원서류B+지원대학목록(루마니아정부장학생).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=94692&attachNo=72326"},{"name":"2. 지원서A (국립국제교육원소정양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=94692&attachNo=72389"},{"name":"1-1. 131025_루마니아정부장학생모집안내(영어번역본).docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=94692&attachNo=72416"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">루마니아정부에서는 2014루마니아정부초청장학생 모집을 아래와 같이 실시하오니, 관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다. </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2014 루마니아 정부초청 장학생 선발요강</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">1. 선발 과정 :</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> 학부, 석사 및 박사 과정(루마니아어 과정만 해당)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2. 선발 인원 :</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> 학부(1), 석사 및 박사과정(3), 4명 선발 추천 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">- 비EU 국가 학생 85명(전세계에서 지원자 선발)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">3. 장학금 지급내역</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(1) 학비 : 면제</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(2) 생활비 : 매월 학부 65유로, 석사 75유로, 박사 85유로 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">- 학사, 석사과정의 경우 여름 방학기간은 생활비가 제공되지 않음.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(3) 숙소(기숙사) 제공</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(4) 식비?항공료?의료보험료 본인 부담(출국전 보험 가입 필수) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">4. 지원 자격</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(1) 대한민국 국적자로서, 건강?병역 등 해외유학에 결격사유가 없는 자</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(2) 고등학교 졸업자, 학사, 석사학위 이상 소지자 등 장학생 과정에 지원</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">할 수 있는 동등학력 소지자- 2014. 2월 취득예정자 포함 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(3) 수학/연구 수행에 필요한 충분한 언어능력을 입증할 수 있는 자 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">5. 선발 절차</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-STYLE: italic; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> 제출된 서류를 심사하여</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(1) 1차 : 본원( 루마니아어, TOEFL, IELTS 등 어학점수, 고교 성적, 학부 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">및 석사과정 G.P.A.) → </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">추천자 발표</span></u></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(2) 합격자 원본 서류 제출 → 주루마니아 한국대사관으로 서류 송부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(3) 2차 : 주루마니아 한국대사관 →루마니아 교육부로 추천자 서류 송부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(4) 3차 : 루마니아 교육부 →최종 합격자 명단 송부 (2014년 6-7월경) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">5. 제출 서류 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(1) 응시원서A (본원 소정양식-한글) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(2) Application B(루마니아 소정양식-영문 혹은, 루마니아어) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(3) 졸업증명서</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">학부과정 - 고교 졸업(예정)증명서(영문)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">석사과정 - 학부 졸업(예정)증 사본 (영문)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">박사과정 - 석사학위 취득(예정)증명서(영문)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(4) 성적증명서</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">학부과정 - 고교 전학년 성적증명서(영문)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">석사과정 - 학부 성적증명서(영문)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">박사과정 - 학부 및 석사과정 전과정 성적증명서(영문 - G.P.A. 기재)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(5) 주민등록초본 (영문) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(6) 여권 사본 (앞면만 복사 첨부)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(7) 신체검사서 (혈액검사, AIDS 검사 포함) (영문)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(8) 이력서(영문)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(9) 여권사진 4매(동일 원판, 뒷면에 영문 이름 명기)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(10) 지도교수 2명의 추천서(영문)-석박사 과정, 양식 없음.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(11) 수학/연구계획서(2-5쪽, 영문)-석박사 과정, 양식 없음.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(12) 루마니아 대학, 고등교육?연구기관, 지도교수 등의 메일 혹은, 초청장</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\